flowchart TD
  A[Authenticated or anonymous request] --> B[Resolve trusted quota identity]
  B --> C[Load route quota policy]
  C --> D[Check rate window]
  D --> E{Within request rate?}
  E -->|No| R429[429 Rate limited]
  E -->|Yes| F[Check concurrent request budget]
  F --> G{Capacity available?}
  G -->|No| R503[503 or documented capacity response]
  G -->|Yes| H[Reserve slot and forward]
  H --> I[Release slot on completion]
  I --> J[Record aggregate quota metrics]
